                    <div style="grid-column:span 3;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;background:#F8FAFC">
                      <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;margin-bottom:4px">First weekly slot</div>
                      <div style="font-size:12px;color:#64748B;margin-bottom:12px">Optional, but recommended: create the first bookable time and its real capacity while adding the service.</div>
                      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px">
                        <div>
                          <label class="adm-label">Day</label>
